1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
You're a jerk, Thom.

2
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:15,900
Look Celia, we have to follow our passions;

3
00:00:21,583 --> 00:00:26,999
...you have your robotics, and I
just want to be awesome in space.

4
00:00:29,499 --> 00:00:29,899
Why don't you just admit that
you're freaked out by my robot hand?

5
00:00:37,415 --> 00:00:40,415
I'm not freaked out by- it's...

6
00:00:42,915 --> 00:00:43,687
...alright! Fine!

7
00:00:48,415 --> 00:00:53,248
I'm freaked out! I have nightmares
that I'm being chased...

8
00:00:55,748 --> 00:00:59,331
...by these giant robotic claws of life...

9
00:01:01,831 --> 00:01:05,747
"Fourty years later"
Whatever, Thom. We're done.

10
00:01:08,247 --> 00:01:11,247
Robot's memory synced and locked!

11
00:01:13,747 --> 00:01:16,747
This is pretty freaky.

12
00:01:19,247 --> 00:01:19,647
Shouldn't you be down there?

13
00:01:24,747 --> 00:01:27,747
I heard you guys talking last night.

14
00:01:30,247 --> 00:01:31,519
It's not my fault, you know.

